1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,031
Could your tummy glow? My tummy can!

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,350
Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,662
Fireflies make cold light!

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,850
Look! No fire!

5
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:13,700
Is a firefly a fly? Nope!

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,425
I'm a little beetle! See? Beetle wing cases!

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,960
Blink, any more secrets? No!

8
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:22,600
Okay, yes.

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,492
Some fireflies flash a secret code!

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Light up, everyone!

11
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:34,447
Six legs? In you go!

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:39,031
Is it winking at me?

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,701
Can YOU blink a secret code?
